  📊 Status Flow

  pending → active → disconnected
     ↓         ↓
     └─────→ expired

  pending:      Created, intro not sent or failed
  active:       Intro sent, accepting messages
  disconnected: Manually disconnected by creator
  expired:      Auto-expired based on expires_at

